.TH TREECHECKERS 1
.SH NAME
treecheckers \- radial checkers game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/treecheckers
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I TreeCheckers
is a radial checkers game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Drag pieces with button 1 on a radial board.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB drag
Select and move unit
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/treecheckers.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
